Circuit: * loop-stability -- tian dual-injection loop-gain testbench for ldo_core (issue #10)

* corner_id=sf_125c_2.97v corner=sf temp_c=125 vin_v=2.97
* ac sweep: dec 400 0.01 1e9 ; Tian dual injection at ERRAMP_OUT->PASS_GATE
* columns: ROW iload_a= ceff_f= esr_ohm= vout_v= dcgain_db= f0_hz= phase_at_f0_deg=
*          f180_hz= gain_at_f180_db= f0_rising_hz= resurgence_db=
* (phase margin = 180 + phase_at_f0_deg ; gain margin = -gain_at_f180_db ;
*  resurgence_db = max |T| in dB above the first 0 dB crossing, DR-0008 ;
*  an empty f180/gain field means the phase never reaches -180 deg in band)
* Fields are written key=value BECAUSE a failed meas leaves its value
* empty: with bare positional fields an empty one vanishes into the
* whitespace and every field after it is read as the wrong quantity.
